## Merge `triplestore` into `graphdb` (one abstraction)

Context: `back/core/triplestore` and `back/core/graphdb` were the same concept
split in two — two base classes (`GraphDBBackend` inherited from
`TripleStoreBackend`), two factories (`TripleStoreFactory` delegated to
`GraphDBFactory`), and two Delta stores (`DeltaFlatStore` wrapped
`DeltaTripleStore`). This is a full conceptual merge into a single `graphdb`
package with one base ABC, one Delta store, and one factory. No back-compat
shims; all imports/call sites repointed and the `triplestore` package deleted.
Behaviour is identical — only structure and names consolidate.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/graphdb/constants.py (new)
   `RDF_TYPE` / `RDFS_LABEL` moved from `triplestore/constants.py`; ~10 importers
   and 2 tests repointed to `back.core.graphdb.constants`.
2. src/back/core/graphdb/GraphDBBackend.py
   Absorbed the full `TripleStoreBackend` body (CRUD + ~600-line named-query /
   reasoning surface) as the single ABC; dropped the `TripleStoreBackend`
   inheritance. `get_connection` / `close` stay abstract.
3. src/back/core/graphdb/delta/DeltaFlatStore.py
   Inlined `DeltaTripleStore`'s raw SQL methods (create/drop/insert/query/count/
   exists/status/optimize/execute); removed the `self._store` delegate. Added a
   domain-less "raw" mode (`domain is None`) so writes go to the exact FQN — used
   by the materialize path and health probes.
4. src/back/core/graphdb/GraphDBFactory.py
   Absorbed `TripleStoreFactory`'s config-resolution statics + view path.
   `create(engine=None)` auto-resolves (former `backend="graph"`);
   `engine="view"` returns a raw read-only `DeltaFlatStore`. `get_graphdb` stays
   the public entry.
5. src/back/core/reasoning/ReasoningService.py, src/back/core/graphdb/delta/health.py
   Construct `DeltaFlatStore(client)` instead of `DeltaTripleStore(client)`.
6. Call sites repointed `get_triplestore(...backend=...)` → `get_graphdb(...engine=...)`
   and `TripleStoreFactory` → `GraphDBFactory`:
   src/back/objects/digitaltwin/DigitalTwin.py, _build_pipeline.py,
   src/api/routers/digitaltwin.py, src/api/routers/internal/dtwin.py,
   src/back/fastapi/graphql_routes.py, src/back/objects/registry/scheduler.py,
   src/front/fastapi/dependencies.py, src/back/core/helpers/SQLHelpers.py.
7. src/back/core/graphdb/__init__.py
   Exports `GraphDBBackend`, `GraphDBFactory`, `get_graphdb`, `GRAPHDB_AVAILABLE`,
   `RDF_TYPE`, `RDFS_LABEL`.
8. Tests updated: test_triplestore_factory.py rewritten for the merged factory
   (auto-resolve + view paths); test_delta_flat_store.py, test_digitaltwin_api.py,
   test_build_pipeline_streaming.py, test_triple_store_backend_config.py patch
   targets repointed to `back.core.graphdb.*`.
9. Docs/rules/diagrams: .cursor/04-project-structure.mdc, src/.coding_rules.md,
